{"id":"u-daa1b5c3-2654-47a2-a813-ce698aa6276d","src":"community","title":"SBD 6 - Kalash Method","author":"Kalash Sharma","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/AurOkG-sbd-6-kalash-method","desc":"This 6-week program is designed for intermediate powerlifters who have already built a solid foundation in the Squat, Bench Press, and Deadlift (SBD), as well as in key variations. The primary goal is to peak strength and maximize performance for a 1-rep max (1RM) test or upcoming meet.\n\nThe program combines RPE-based autoregulation with percentage-based progressions to balance structure with individual readiness. Throughout the cycle, you will encounter AMRAP sets to push capacity, gauge progress, and build mental toughness. Variation lifts are included to address weaknesses, improve movement efficiency, and carry over directly to your competition lifts.\n\nThis program is ideal for lifters who:\n\nHave experience with proper lifting form and technique\n\nUnderstand basic RPE concepts\n\nHave previously trained with accessory and variation lifts\n\nAre looking to transition from a general strength phase into a peaking block\n\n\nEach week is carefully structured to drive adaptive overload while managing fatigue, allowing you to arrive at Week 6 feeling strong, sharp, and ready to perform.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":100,"joins":9,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T16:11:11.513Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Squat + Bench","Deadlift","Rest","Squat + Bench","Deadlift","Benchpress"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":1,"pct":80},{"r":4,"pct":70,"x":2}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"pct":70}]},{"n":"Larsen Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r